# flair project file
Version: 300
Mode: fluka
Title: Charged pion fluence inside and around a proton-irradiated Be target
md5: c7d3bdf2eeec89710a4949caac8f3144
Input:
*...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+....8
TITLE
	Charged pion fluence inside and around a proton-irradiated Be target
*...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+....8
BEAM PROTON 50.E+00
BEAMPOS , 0.0 0.0 -10.0
*
GEOBEGIN COMBNAME
	A simple Be target inside vacuum
RPP body1 -5000000.0 +5000000.0 -5000000.0 +5000000.0 -5000000.0 +5000000.0
RPP body2 -1000000.0 +1000000.0 -1000000.0 +1000000.0 -100.0 +1000000.0
RPP body3 -2.5 +2.5 -5.5 +5.5 0.0 +9.5
* plane to separate the upstream and downstream part of the target
XYP body4 4.8
END
* black hole
REGION regBH1 5
	+body1 -body2
* vacuum around
REGION regVA2 5
	+body2 -body3
* Be target 1st half
REGION regBE3 5
	+body3 +body4
* Be target 2nd half
REGION regBE4 5
	+body3 -body4
END
GEOEND
*...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+....8
MATERIAL BERYLLIU 4.0,, 1.848 5.0
*...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+....8
*  Be target, 1st and 2nd half
ASSIGNMA , BERYLLIU regBE3 regBE4
*  External Black Hole
ASSIGNMA , BLCKHOLE regBH1
*  Vacuum
ASSIGNMA , VACUUM regVA2
*...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+....8
* e+e- and gamma production threshold set at 10 MeV
EMFCUT PROD-CUT -0.010 0.010 1.0 BERYLLIU
* score in each region energy deposition and stars produced by primaries
SCORE , ENERGY BEAMPART
* Boundary crossing fluence in the middle of the target (log intervals, one-way)
USRBDX piFluenUD 99.0 PIONS+- -46 regBE3 regBE4 400. 50.0 1E-9 +50.0,, 0.0 10.0
* Boundary crossing current in the middle of the target (log intervals, one-way)
USRBDX piCurrUD -1.0 PIONS+- -47.0 regBE3 regBE4 400. +50.0 1E-9 +50.0,, 0.0 10.0
* Tracklength fluence inside the target, Upstream part and Downstream part
* Logarithmic energy intervals
USRTRACK piFluenU -1.0 PIONS+- -48.0 regBE3 1000.0 20. 50.0 0.001
USRTRACK piFluenD -1.0 PIONS+- -49.0 regBE4 1000.0 20. 50.0 0.001
* Cartesian binning of the pion fluence inside and around the target
USRBIN piFluBin 10.0 PIONS+- -50.0 50.0 50.0 50. -50.0 -50.0 -10.0 100.0 100.0 \
	 60.0
* Cartesian binning of the deposited energy inside the target
USRBIN Edeposit 10.0 ENERGY -51.0 10.0 10.0 5. -10.0 -10.0 0.0 20.0 20.0 5.0
*...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+....8
RANDOMIZ , 1 1.0
*...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+....8
START , 300000.0
STOP
EndInput

Page: Plot
plotengine: Gnuplot

